---
import Site from "../../layouts/Site.astro";
import { HOWTO } from "../../data/nav.js";
const headings = HOWTO.map((g, i) => ({ slug: `g${i}`, text: g.group, depth: 2 }));
---
<Site title="How-to：具体怎么做" headings={headings}>
  <article class="xxd-prose">
    <h1>How-to：具体怎么做</h1>
    <p>一篇只讲一件事，带截图，按你的设备分开写。主线教程里遇到「这一步具体怎么点」，就来这里找。</p>
    <p class="xxd-text" data-variant="secondary">下面是计划要写的清单，正在陆续编写。</p>
    {HOWTO.map((g, i) => (
      <>
        <h2 id={`g${i}`}>{g.group}</h2>
        <ul>{g.items.map((t) => <li>{t} <span class="xxd-badge">编写中</span></li>)}</ul>
      </>
    ))}
  </article>
</Site>
